[url=https://github.com/hackclub/slack.hackclub.com/pull/34]Contributed to the hack club website[/url][/ul]

Are they both one file changes? yes but doesn't chnage the fact that I worked on them

More to come so stay tuned ig
(Idk why you will be waiting for some random kids updates but if you are then thank you!"
